---
// Site footer with tagline about section and team info
---
<footer class="footer">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="footer-brand">
      <p class="footer-site-name">CodeObsessed</p>
      <p class="footer-tagline">Made for curious coders</p>
    </div>

    <div class="footer-section">
      <h3 class="footer-heading">About CodeObsessed</h3>
      <p class="footer-body">
        CodeObsessed was established to demystify the complexities
        of the modern programming landscape by providing structured,
        transparent guidance for aspiring developers. We aim to
        transform the overwhelming influx of technical information
        into a coherent professional roadmap, ensuring that no
        beginner has to navigate the transition from theory to
        industry-ready expertise alone.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="footer-section">
      <h3 class="footer-heading">The Team</h3>
      <p class="footer-body">
        Pranjal Bhatt &amp; Shivansh Bansal<br />
        Co-founders — India<br />
        All content is AI-assisted and human-reviewed.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="footer-contact">
      Get in touch: <a href="mailto:pranjalbhatt2008@gmail.com">pranjalbhatt2008@gmail.com</a>
    </div>

    <div class="footer-bottom">
      Open source. Always free. Built with curiosity.
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  .footer {
    background: #1e1e2e;
    padding: 3rem 0;
    margin-top: 3rem;
    border-top: 1px solid #2a2a3a;
  }

  .footer-brand {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .footer-site-name {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #ffffff;
    margin: 0 0 0.25rem;
  }

  .footer-tagline {
    color: #a0a0b0;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .footer-section {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto 1.5rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .footer-heading {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #3b82f6;
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  .footer-body {
    color: #a0a0b0;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .footer-contact {
    text-align: center;
    color: #a0a0b0;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .footer-contact a {
    color: #3b82f6;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .footer-contact a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .footer-bottom {
    text-align: center;
    color: #6a6a7a;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    border-top: 1px solid #2a2a3a;
    padding-top: 1.5rem;
  }
</style>
